<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Beneficial Corp cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Beneficial Corp cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities analyst John A. Heffern said he cut his rating on Beneficial Corp to hold from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- &quot;The stock has appreciated over eight percent over the past month alone, reaching its 52-week highs and our $65 target price,&quot; Heffern said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1/4 at 64-1/8.</p>
